if free and used by only one person; it also requires separate written permission.
Use of the official distributed app is governed by its applicable app/service
terms, not this source license. Permission for one use does not authorize others.

This is a restricted source-available license, not an open-source license.
It grants no access to official infrastructure, customer data, developer accounts,
signing credentials or production services, and no authority to release the app.
Nothing here limits rights independently granted under applicable GitHub terms
